{
  "title": "AI Usage Exporter — Overview",
  "uid": "ai-usage-overview",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": { "from": "now-30d", "to": "now" },
  "tags": ["ai-usage-exporter"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "refresh": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "tool",
        "label": "tool",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
        "query": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens, tool)",
        "definition": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens, tool)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
        "query": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens{tool=~\"$tool\"}, model)",
        "definition": "label_values(ai_usage_tokens{tool=~\"$tool\"}, model)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "window",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "24h,7d,30d,mtd,all",
        "options": [
          { "text": "24h", "value": "24h", "selected": false },
          { "text": "7d", "value": "7d", "selected": false },
          { "text": "30d", "value": "30d", "selected": true },
          { "text": "mtd", "value": "mtd", "selected": false },
          { "text": "all", "value": "all", "selected": false }
        ],
        "current": { "text": "30d", "value": "30d" },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fila de estado",
      "description": "Cuatro cifras de estado para la ventana $window: tokens totales, coste estimado, sesiones distintas, y frescura del snapshot (time() - ai_usage_scan_timestamp_seconds, en segundos). Este exporter parsea una sola vez al arrancar (ADR-001): la cuarta cifra no es decorativa, es la única señal en este dashboard de que los datos están viejos porque el proceso lleva mucho tiempo sin reiniciarse. Umbral amarillo a partir de 1h sin reinicio, rojo a partir de 24h.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum(ai_usage_tokens{window=\"$window\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Tokens totales",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum(ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"$window\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Coste USD",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum(ai_usage_sessions{window=\"$window\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Sesiones",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "time() - ai_usage_scan_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "Frescura del snapshot",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "currencyUSD" }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "D" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "yellow", "value": 3600 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 86400 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Tokens por herramienta",
      "description": "Tokens totales de la ventana $window agregados por tool, sin distinguir modelo ni clase de token. Es una gauge agregada por ventana (ADR-001), no un counter: no aplicar rate() ni increase() sobre esta serie.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"$window\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "xTickLabelRotation": 0, "showValue": "always" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Coste por modelo",
      "description": "Coste estimado en USD de la ventana $window agregado por model, ordenado de mayor a menor. Derivado del catálogo de precios vigente al momento del escaneo, no del coste nativo que algún provider pueda reportar (docs/metrics.md, 'Reconciliación con el coste nativo').",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"$window\", tool=~\"$tool\", model=~\"$model\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Value", "desc": true }] } }
      ],
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "xTickLabelRotation": 0, "showValue": "always" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Reparto por clase de token",
      "description": "Tokens de la ventana $window repartidos por token_type (input, output, cache_read, cache_write, reasoning). Las cinco clases son disjuntas por contrato (docs/metrics.md): esta dona es la forma más directa de ver cuánto del consumo ya se está ahorrando vía caché.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum by (token_type) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"$window\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{token_type}}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "pieType": "donut", "displayLabels": ["percent"], "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tendencia de tokens",
      "description": "ai_usage_tokens{window=\"24h\"} por tool, en el tiempo. ADVERTENCIA: esta serie es una gauge agregada por ventana, no un counter (ADR-001) — NUNCA aplicar rate() ni increase() sobre ella. La línea avanza al ritmo de los reinicios/re-escaneos del exporter, no de forma continua: un tramo plano entre dos puntos es el proceso corriendo sin reiniciar, no ausencia de uso.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (ai_usage_tokens{window=\"24h\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Coste acumulado del mes",
      "description": "sum(ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"mtd\"}) across todos los tool y model. Ventana month-to-date re-derivada del historial local en cada arranque (ADR-001): no es un contador que suba de forma monótona durante la vida del proceso.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "sum(ai_usage_cost_usd{window=\"mtd\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Salud del exporter",
      "description": "Estado del último escaneo al arranque: disponibilidad por provider, archivos/filas leídas, errores de parseo, duración del escaneo, timestamp del evento más reciente por tool, y metadatos de build. Todo gauge fijado en el arranque (ADR-001): esta tabla no cambia hasta el siguiente reinicio del proceso.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "ai_usage_provider_available",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "ai_usage_scan_files",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "ai_usage_scan_errors",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "ai_usage_scan_duration_seconds",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "ai_usage_last_event_timestamp_seconds",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "expr": "ai_usage_build_info",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {}
    }
  ]
}
